13”). The amendments in this ASU modify the disclosure requirements on fair value measurements. ASU 2018-13 is effective for public entities for fiscal years beginning after December 15, 2019, with early adoption permitted for any removed or modified disclosures. The removed and modified disclosures will be adopted on a retrospective basis and the new disclosures will be adopted on a prospective basis.","context":"New Accounting Pronouncements Recently Adopted","section":"Segment reporting","block":210,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001185185-26-003674","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-08-21","reportDate":"2026-03-31","cik":"0001687451","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1687451/000118518526003674/zkinex99-1.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/f10dc148664b43d40868f41f7808175b976b73cc9e75e5c353be79cdc7505e89.bin","sha256":"f10dc148664b43d40868f41f7808175b976b73cc9e75e5c353be79cdc7505e89"}},{"id":"877c9c3ad9e068bda0a58b2b8c388c297a316b2913bb0e3c94beffaa3e7a9a48","quote":"F-17","context":"In August 2018, the FASB issued ASU No. 2018-13, “Fair Value Measurement (Topic 820): Disclosure Framework Changes to the Disclosure Requirements for Fair Value Measurement” (“ASU 2018-13”). The amendments in this ASU modify the disclosure requirements on fair value measurements. ASU 2018-13 is effective for public entities for fiscal years beginning after December 15, 2019, with early adoption permitted for any removed or modified disclosures. The removed and modified disclosures will be adopted on a retrospective basis and the new disclosures will be adopted on a prospective basis.","section":"Segment reporting","block":211,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001185185-26-003674","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-08-21","reportDate":"2026-03-31","cik":"0001687451","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archive